OL,3,AManhunt after shooting at Swiss rave
OL,4,Akills woman, 22, and injures five
OL,5,
OL,6,FAarau cantonal police spokesman Michael
OL,7,FLeupold told a news conference on
OL,8,FSunday afternoon that officers were
OL,9,F"still in the midst of the operation"
OL,10,Fand had no leads on who may have been
OL,11,Fbehind the shooting.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
